{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin",
  "talk_popup_popup.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "He might've won my trial, but you're the one\nwho found the key evidence.": "",
  "Shintani got recognition, sure.\nBut it was only by association.": "",
  "Shintani got recognition...\nbut it was only by association.": "",
  "Nobody said it, but they all knew.\nYou did the real work.": "",
  "Nobody said it. Not to his face.\nBut everyone knew.": "",
  "But even then, you didn't stop\ntrying to show up the poor guy.": "",
  "But that didn't stop you.\nYou just kept one-upping the guy.": "",
  "Right when the trial came to a close,\nthere you were hunting the real killer down.": "",
  "Soon as the trial came to a close,\nyou started hunting the real killer down.": "",
  "How do you think Shintani felt, sitting around\nwaiting for you to stumble onto the truth?": "",
  "So, how do you think that must have felt for Shintani?\nSitting around, waiting for you to stumble onto the truth?": "",
  "Can't imagine he was sleeping well.": "",
  "Can't imagine he felt great.": "",
  "Shintani wanted to find the truth before\nyou did. Wanted to earn his time in the sun.": "",
  "Shintani wanted to find the truth before you did.\nIf he solved it, he'd finally get his time in the sun.": "",
  "Heh. You might as well let\nthis Mole shit go.": "",
  "And that's why he called the ADDC?\nTo investigate the killings himself?": "",
  "So, Shintani... was trying to investigate the killings himself?\nThat's why he called the ADDC?": "",
  "That's my theory. Can't back it up, though.\nEither way, the end result was the same.": "",
  "Sounds pretty fuckin' logical to me.\nEither way, we know how it ended.": "",
  "Ichinose found out Shintani was trying to get\nin touch with Shono. Signed his own death sentence.": "",
  "Shintani definitely tried to get in touch with Shono.\nAnd Ichinose sniffed that out.": "",
  "I'm sure it was plain as day that I was the guy\nwho put him on the right trail.": "",
  "He probably knew right off\nthe bat I'd slipped him that info.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So, Ichinose's the one who\ngave the order...)</color>": "",
  "So... I had no choice but to silence Shintani.\nI even paid for the job outta my own pocket.": "",
  "So it fell to me. I had no choice but to silence Shintani.\nCalled the Mole... paid for the job outta my own pocket.": "",
  "And when it came to setting up\na fall guy... we picked Ayabe.": "",
  "And when we needed a fall guy...\nwe picked Ayabe.": "",
  "Stay outta this, boss!": "",
  "Boss! Stay out of our way!": "",
  "Let the captain go!": "",
  "Tak! Get these guys off of me!": "",
  "Come on, do something!": "",
  "Dammit! Come on, do something!": "",
  "Hot!": "",
  "You okay, Tak?": "",
  "Tak, you okay?": "",
  "There's no time to lose!": "",
  "You're playing with fire.": "",
  "We done here!?": "",
  "What, not done yet?": "",
  "Fucking finally.": "",
  "And Patriarch Matsugane?": "",
  "...And Patriarch Matsugane?": "",
  "He... didn't make it.": "",
  "Didn't make it.": "",
  "Oh no...": "",
  "It was Kuroiwa...": "",
  "Hm? Did you say something?": "",
  "Back at the center of\nthe crime scene, eh, Yagami?": "",
  "Getting yourself into trouble\nagain, Yagami?": "",
  "What the hell...? You son of a—": "",
  "Yagami-kun?\nWhat's going on?": "",
  "Wait! What's going on?": "",
  "Don't fret, Fujii-san. We just need to have\na little chat at the station.": "",
  "No need to worry, Prosecutor. We just need to\nhave a little chat at the station.": "",
  "No, he needs to get to a hospital.": "",
  "No. I'm taking him to a hospital.": "",
  "He looks fine to me.\nI'll watch after him otherwise.": "",
  "Looks fine to me.\nWhy bother a doctor?": "",
  "Are you a doctor now?\nHe needs professional attention.": "",
  "I'd rather he get an opinion\nfrom a professional.": "",
  "Enough protesting.\nHe'll be just fine with me.": "",
  "I don't think that'll be necessary.\nI'll see to it he stays safe.": "",
  "You don't even have a reason!": "",
  "But how can you do that!?": "",
  "It's okay. I'll go with you.\nI'm sure I'll be fine.": "",
  "It's okay. I can go with him.\nI'll be fine.": "",
  "(I'm... exhausted.\nI just want to crash.)": "",
  "Hiya, mister!\nAre you Yagami?": "",
  "Hiya, mister! Are you Yagami?": "",
  "Yeah? Who's asking?": "",
  "...Hm? Who's asking?": "",
  "I have a present for you.": "",
  "Here, take it!": "",
  "I dunno! Some guy told me to give\nit to you. He said he was a friend.": "",
  "I dunno! Some guy told me to give it to you.\nHe said he was a friend.": "",
  "Oh, and he said to open\nit right away!": "",
  "He said to open it right away!": "",
  "What the!": "",
  "Wonderful, Yagami-san! Such stunning reflexes!\nYou even avoided doing any property damage!": "",
  "Wonderful, Yagami-san! Such stunning reflexes!\nYou even avoided damaging the nearby buildings!": "",
  "Well? Did you enjoy my present?": "",
  "Did you enjoy my present?": "",
  "It was given to me as a gift,\nby an old business partner of mine.": "",
  "Oh, pardon my rudeness.": "",
  "This is my card.": "",
  "Koga?": "",
  "Oh, you don't know me?": "",
  "Hm? Have you not heard of me?": "",
  "Hm, I see, I see...": "",
  "Hm... I see, I see.": "",
  "In that case, perhaps I should start over.\nMy name is Matsuhisa Koga... one of the Keihin Four.": "",
  "I am Matsuhisa Koga... one of the Keihin Four.\nDoes that clarify the matter?": "",
  "I came to see what all\nthe fuss is about.": "",
  "Tonight, I'm just here to\nevaluate you.": "",
  "And introduce you to my\nway of doing things.": "",
  "And introduce you to my methods.": "",
  "You know, our reputation has taken\nquite a hit thanks to your antics.": "",
  "Thanks to your antics, our organization's reputation\nhas taken quite a hit.": "",
  "That being the case,\nit falls to me to put a stop to this farce.": "",
  "It's quite embarrassing. I'm afraid I cannot\nallow this farce to continue.": "",
  "You guys are the farce...": "",
  "You're embarrassing yourselves.": "",
  "Hmph. Enough talk.\nShow me what you can do, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Well, that's enough talk.\nShow me what you can do, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Ngh, you're as strong as they said you'd be.\nIt seems fortune is not on my side today.": "",
  "Ngh... you're as strong as they say.\nWhat a shame... Fortune wasn't on my side.": "",
  "I surrender. You win.": "",
  "Huh? Already...?": "",
  "In the business world,\none must always know when to withdraw.": "",
  "In the business world, one must always know\nwhen to withdraw.": "",
  "If Matsuhisa Koga lost to some thug on the street,\nour reputation would be in tatters.": "",
  "If <font_kind=yakuza_italic>the</font_kind> Matsuhisa Koga lost to some thug\non the street, our reputation would be in tatters.": "",
  "My business partners would never\ntake me seriously again.": "",
  "I don't know why they\nwould to begin with.": "",
  "You're the street thug here.": "",
  "Now, I must retire.\nUntil the day I get revenge.": "",
  "At any rate, I must retire.\nMy revenge will come another day.": "",
  "Farewell, Yagami-san.": "",
  "For now, though, farewell.": "",
  "Can't these guys just leave me alone?": "",
  "Can't these guys just leave me alone...?": "",
  "What happened with Kaito-san?\nIs he okay?": "",
  "Where's Kaito-san?\nIs he okay?": "",
  "Doctor said he'll be back on his feet in a few days.\nWe took him to some back-alley joint. Hush hush, y'know.": "",
  "Didn't realize you had\nthose kinds of connections.": "",
  "Didn't realize you had those\nkinds of connections.": "",
  "Actually, he was a friend of Kaito-san's.\nSounded like they go way back.": "",
  "Couldn't you have just gone to a hospital?": "",
  "Couldn't you have just\ngone to a hospital?": "",
  "That's what I thought.\nKaito-san was pretty insistent, though.": "",
  "That's what I thought.\nKaito-san wasn't having it, though.": "",
  "Said he didn't have time to deal\nwith a bullet in the gut.": "",
  "Said this is no time\nto be lyin' around.": "",
  "That's Kaito.": "",
  "'Course he did.": "",
  "How'd everything go with you?\nI heard that Kyorei club burned down.": "",
  "How'd everything go with you?\nI heard that Kyorei cabaret burned down.": "",
  "Yeah. Things were... tough.": "",
  "Yeah. I wouldn't say it went well.": "",
  "Sounds like you could\nuse some rest, then.": "",
  "Sounds like you could use\nsome rest, then.": "",
  "Heading out then?": "",
  "Not sticking around?": "",
  "I just figured I'd stop by\nto tell you about Kaito-san.": "",
  "Nah, I just came to tell you\nabout Kaito-san.": "",
  "Now that I know you're safe, too...\nI'm gonna go pass out at home.": "",
  "Now that I know you're safe, too...\nI'm gonna go pass out for a bit.": "",
  "You do that. G'night.": "",
  "You do that. Night.": "",
  "Yagami-kun? It's Mafuyu.\nDid I wake you up?": "",
  "Oh, ah... It's Mafuyu.\nDid I wake you up?": "",
  "The Mole's claimed another victim.\nAnother Kyorei Clan yakuza.": "",
  "Head to the Matsugane Family\noffice if you can.": "",
  "He was found... just outside\nthe Matsugane office.": "",
  "All right. I'll be right over.": "",
  "They've already ID'ed the victim.": "",
  "They've already ID'ed the victim.\nI'll tell you...": "",
  "Satoshi Shioya. Captain of the Kyorei Clan.\nYou knew him, yes?": "",
  "It was a Kyorei Clan captain, Shioya.\nYou knew him, right?": "",
  "Mhm. If it was really the Mole...\nThat means his eyes have been gouged out?": "",
  "Mhm. Then if it was really the Mole...\nhis eyes were...?": "",
  "So I hear.\nI haven't confirmed it for myself.": "",
  "Yes. Though I haven't confirmed it\nfor myself.": "",
  "Better that you don't.": "",
  "Who's handling the case?\nKuroiwa again?": "",
  "Yes. He's right over there.": "",
  "Speaking of which, Yagami-kun.\nWhat happened last night? With the interrogation.": "",
  "Yagami-kun. What happened last night?\nAre you all right?": "",
  "Listen, Mafuyu.": "",
  "Hey, Mafuyu.": "",
  "It's Kuroiwa.\nHe's the Mole.": "",
  "It's Kuroiwa. He's the Mole.": "",
  "Apparently he and Hamura have been\nworking together for years.": "",
  "He and Captain Hamura...\nThey've been working together for years.": "",
  "At first he was just a dirty cop.\nNot too different from Ayabe, I'd guess.": "",
  "At first... he wasn't too different from Ayabe.\nJust another dirty cop.": "",
  "But eventually he found\nmurder was profitable.": "",
  "But eventually he decided murder's\nwhere the money is.": "",
  "That's not all. Shono from the ADDC is the one\nwho's been hiring him to do his dirty laundry.": "",
  "On top of that, the Mole's just following orders.\nFor Shono, from the ADDC.": "",
  "And these corpses with their eyes gouged out?\nHuman experiments, every one of them. All for AD-9.": "",
  "And these corpses with their eyes gouged out?\nAll human experiments in the name of AD-9.": "",
  "Shintani's dead.\nKilled by Ayabe, so they claim.": "",
  "Shintani was killed with a policeman's gun.\nThey say Ayabe did it.": "",
  "This is the pretrial conference for that case.": "",
  "This is the pretrial conference\nfor that case.": "",
  "Basically, we sit in here and hammer out the flow of the trial.\nTry to keep things as simple as possible for the jury, y'know.": "",
  "According to the law, both the prosecution and the defense\nhave to submit all their evidence before even going to court.": "",
  "Both the prosecution and the defense have to submit\nall their evidence before even going to court.": "",
  "You can't burst in mid-trial with\nnew info like they do in the movies.": "",
  "You can't burst in mid-trial with new info,\nlike they do in the movies.": "",
  "In other words, we need to make sure all our cards\nare in order... then show the other side our hand.": "",
  "We've been going in circles\nfor a while now.": "",
  "We've been going in circles for a while now.": "",
  "We'll never get anywhere like this.": "",
  "You say that, yes. But we're only trying\nto protect the defendant's best interests.": "",
  "You say that, but we're only trying to protect\nthe defendant's best interests.": "",
  "The rifling marks on the bullet are\nunshakable proof of guilt.": "",
  "The rifling marks on the bullet\nare undeniable proof of guilt.": "",
  "You really want to plead innocent\nwith such a severe disadvantage?": "",
  "You really want to plead innocent\nat that kind of disadvantage?": "",
  "How does the defense respond? You can also bargain\nfor a lesser sentence if you so desire.": "",
  "Your response? Remember that you can\nbargain for a lesser sentence.": "",
  "No, we still contend that Detective Ayabe\nwas set up. Our stance remains unchanged.": "",
  "No, we still contend that Detective Ayabe was set up.\nOur stance remains unchanged.": "",
  "...Got it.": "",
  "So it was Kuroiwa all along.": "",
  "So it was Kuroiwa...\nHe's the Mole.": "",
  "Everything makes sense now.": "",
  "That explains a lot.": "",
  "Were there ever any warning signs?": "",
  "This might have nothin' to do with it,\nbut I heard a story about the guy once.": "",
  "Back when he was startin' out, his boss on the force\nwas working as a Tojo Clan go-between on the side.": "",
  "Back when Kuroiwa started out, his boss on the force\nhad a side job, too. Workin' as a Tojo Clan go-between.": "",
  "In exchange for kickbacks and whores, of course.\nKinda shit you see every day in Kamurocho.": "",
  "In exchange for kickbacks and whores.\nKinda shit you see every day in Kamurocho.": "",
  "But one day, that boss went and threw himself off a roof.\nRight when they were gonna haul him in, too.": "",
  "But one day, that boss went and threw himself off a roof.\nRight when they were gonna arrest him.": "",
  "Guess some goody two shoes on the force\nwent and ratted him out.": "",
  "...Guess some hotshot on the force\nwent and ratted him out.　": "",
  "One of his own coworkers?\nWas it Kuroiwa?": "",
  "One of his own coworkers betrayed him...?\nKuroiwa?": "",
  "Nope. Funny enough, they found the snitch\nwith a noose 'round his neck just a day later.": "",
  "So it was a double suicide...?": "",
  "Oh... So it was a double suicide...?": "",
  "From what I've heard, it's possible\nthat hanging was actually a homicide.": "",
  "Some people think the hanging\nwas actually a homicide.": "",
  "Maybe, just maybe...\nSomeone wanted revenge on the snitch.": "",
  "Just maybe... someone wanted revenge\non the snitch.": "",
  "After the dust cleared, a new dirty cop had risen\nfrom the ashes. With his boss's connections, and then some.": "",
  "After that... a new dirty cop rose from the ashes.\nWith his boss's connections, and then some.": "",
  "He's been in bed with the yakuza ever since.\nTurns out, this guy's our top detective, too.": "",
  "He's been in bed with the yakuza ever since.\nOn top of being our ace detective, too.": "",
  "And you're saying that's Kuroiwa?": "",
  "Hey, I'm just telling you what I heard.\nYou're the one who asked about warning signs.": "",
  "That's just what I heard.\nYou asked about warning signs.": "",
  "Let's split up, Hoshino-kun. Sticking with me\nis just gonna put you in more danger.": "",
  "We should probably split up. If you stick with me,\nyou'll just be in more danger.": "",
  "Come on, I'll be fine.\nI'm not a little kid.": "",
  "I know that.\nEither way, we're done for today.": "",
  "I know that. Either way,\nwe're done for today.": "",
  "Oh. Okay then.\nI'll see you around, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Are we...? Okay...": "",
  "...Hattori?": "",
  "Someone's got eyes on your place.": "",
  "Smells like it does when\na journalist stakes out a shoot.": "",
  "Smells like it does when a journalist\nstakes out a shoot.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Oh no...": "โอ้ ไม่นะ...",
  "...Got it.": "...รับทราบครับ"
 }
}
